gbs-anywhere ESP32-S3 companion

This experimental ESP-IDF application was split from the firmware/esp32-s3
directory of Skamba/gbs-anywhere PR #18, originally contributed by zpmdd at
commit 8c19924d7ca3549a8692190c5aa30b24d26ebd75.

The Generic WiFi flow and La Marzocco authentication were ported from
gbs-anywhere by Skamba, erikp152 and its contributors:
https://github.com/Skamba/gbs-anywhere
https://github.com/Skamba/gbs-anywhere/pull/15
https://github.com/Skamba/gbs-anywhere/pull/16
Authentication snapshot: 3b6ef9abd823f5e8ebd66fdc229a5738c0f0930e (unchanged in PR16 ba00c92).
Protocol flow reviewed against merged main 3adf778c7f0a3803994cbcc5fe2af1f8ac8a5be1,
including PR15 fix 13e4a053e596609b78402a2b25015a816dfe7de5, on 2026-10-17.
Cloud authentication is unchanged between PR16 ba00c92 and that merged main.
Desktop pairing on V01.36 requires the merged recovery flow from PR #15.

